1 NAME Josipa (Jozefa) /Zichy/
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1725
1 DEAT
2 DATE 6 MAY 1778
1 FAMS @F33@
1 FAMC @F34@
1 NOTE Countess Zichy; died Bisztra. Wife of Krsto II Orssich (m. 1744): Nagy Iván, vol. 8, Orsich; Croatian Wikipedia, Krsto II. Oršić (Josipa Zichy, 1725-1778). Daughter of Péter Zichy (1674-1726) and his 
2 CONC second wife Zsuzsanna Bercsényi (1691-1745): Miroslav Marek, Genealogy.EU, Zichy 2, http://genealogy.euweb.cz/hung/zichy2.html ('Jozefa, *1725, +Bistra 6.5.1778; m.Pest 1744 Gf Kristóf Orssich de Slav
2 CONC etich'). Born 1725, consistent with her death 'in her 53rd year' in 1778 (Muzej seljačkih buna (Peasants' Revolt Museum, Oršić castle, Gornja Stubica), 'Obitelj Oršić', https://msb.mhz.hr/obitelj-orsi
2 CONC c/). Nagy Iván, vol. 12, Zichy, lists that marriage's children incompletely and omits her; Wurzbach (BLKÖ, Zichy-Vásonykeő, Peter) gives seven children of both marriages. The Croatian History Museum's
2 CONC  birth date 'Buda, 1732/5' conflicts. Source: Tötösy de Zepetnek, Records of the Tötösy de Zepetnek Family (Purdue), Orssich section.
